        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. In the event a Senior or Department Steward is to be reassigned, temporarily or permanently, from the area or shifts for which certified, the Bargaining Unit Labor Relations Representative shall orally notify and discuss in advance such reassignment with the Senior Business Representative of the Union prior to the reassignment.",
